Server init.
>> a := Blob baharu: 4.
a bytes: ( Senarai baharu ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob baharu: 4.
b bytes: ( Senarai baharu ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a baharu.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Keluaran tulis: ['xorred:'], baris-baharu. 
Keluaran tulis: n, baris-baharu. 
} tangkap: { :e Keluaran tulis: e, baris-baharu. }, mula.
a bebaskan.
b bebaskan.
